                            <h4 class="pb-2" style="color: white;">Importance of New Blood</h4>
                            <p style="color: white;">
                                New blood is essential for preventing inbreeding. This helps to largely rule out hereditary defects, ensuring the creation of a healthy line.
                            </p>


